Third-party works in this repository
------------------------------------

The 0BSD grant above covers the code and data written for delphitools. The
files below are the work of others, carried in this repository under their
own licences, which continue to apply to them:

  app/src/main/assets/nerdamer-all.min.js
      nerdamer 1.1.13 (Martin Donk), MIT.

  app/src/main/cpp/minimp3/minimp3.h, minimp3_ex.h
      minimp3 at commit 48e3a08 (lieff), CC0-1.0; see
      app/src/main/cpp/minimp3/LICENSE.

  app/src/main/assets/svgo.browser.js
      SVGO 4.0.0 browser build (Kir Belevich and SVGO contributors), MIT.

  app/src/main/assets/colour-names.json
      The "bestof" list of color-names (David Aerne and contributors), MIT.

  app/src/main/assets/shavian-dictionary-core.json,
  app/src/main/assets/shavian-dictionary-full.json
      Derived from the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary (Carnegie Mellon
      University), BSD-2-Clause.

  app/src/main/assets/password-eff-wordlist.txt
      EFF long wordlist (Electronic Frontier Foundation), CC BY 3.0.

  app/src/main/assets/world-land.json
      Derived from the Natural Earth 110 m land polygons
      (naturalearthdata.com), public domain.

  app/src/main/assets/unicode-blocks.json
      Derived from Blocks.txt of the Unicode Character Database
      (Unicode, Inc.), Unicode License v3.

  app/src/main/res/font/fluo_write.otf
      FluoWrite (Speak the Sky, https://speakthesky.com), proprietary;
      free for print and digital use, not for redistribution as a font.

  app/src/main/res/font/iosevka_regular.ttf, iosevka_semibold.ttf,
  iosevka_bold.ttf
      Iosevka (Renzhi Li), SIL Open Font License 1.1; see
      app/src/main/assets/licenses/iosevka.txt.

  app/src/main/res/font/roboto_flex.ttf
      Roboto Flex (The Roboto Flex Project Authors), SIL Open Font
      License 1.1.

  app/src/main/java/com/delphi/delphitools/tools/images/ImageTracerEngine.kt
      Contains a Kotlin port of imagetracerjs 1.2.6 (Andras Jankovics),
      The Unlicense.

Artwork is not covered by this licence: the stickers in
app/src/main/assets/stickers/ and app/src/main/assets/tool-stickers/ and
the delphi mark remain the property of their artists and are used with
their permission.

Gradle dependencies and models fetched at run time (the
background-removal model, speech-recognition models) are not part of this
repository and keep their own licences.
